    kind: 0
    trigger: 1
    target: denk_1
    title: "Kuru \xC7e\u015Fme"
    description: "K-1 \xB7 Tepkimede atomlar\u0131n t\xFCr\xFC ve say\u0131s\u0131
      korunur; de\u011Fi\u015Fen ba\u011Flan\u0131\u015Flar\u0131d\u0131r.\n2H<sub>2</sub>
