    kind: 0
    trigger: 1
    target: denk_4
    title: "Y\u0131k\u0131k K\xF6pr\xFC"
    description: "K-4 \xB7 Bir tepkimenin \xFCr\xFCn\xFC ba\u015Fka bir tepkimenin
